   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Deltares isan independent knowledge institute for applied research in the field of water and subsurface. Deltares works throughout the world and we are guided by the major societal issues, for which Deltares&apos; knowledge is indispensable. For more than a century, Deltares has been working passionately to find answers to the burning question that drives its research: how can we keep our deltas, and coastal and river areas, safe, sustainable, and liveable - both now and in the future.</narrative>
